{"3865960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cortesia Rising", "steam_appid": 3865960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     Cortesia Rising is a Space Captain Simulator that combines spaceship battles, ship &amp; crew management, and turn-based tactical combat. Engage in broadside naval battles, run trading and smuggling operations, take on missions, explore planets, maintain crew morale through supplies and wages, and upgrade your ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865960/extras/ae958bc277495baab3cb12039c8fe0cb.poster.avif?t=1788193999\" aria-label=\"A single warship engages a line of merchant ships in a broadside battle.\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865960/extras/ae958bc277495baab3cb12039c8fe0cb.webm?t=1788193999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865960/extras/ae958bc277495baab3cb12039c8fe0cb.mp4?t=1788193999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     The same officers you recruit and level-up also fight alongside you in detailed tactical battles during boarding actions and planetside gunfights. The integration of these systems creates consistent progression: the crew you manage directly impacts both your success in space and your effectiveness in tactical combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865960/extras/5add809143141fad0a64d01f6f566a8d.poster.avif?t=1788193999\" aria-label=\"A boarding party fights their way through the tight corridors of a starship to reach the Bridge.\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865960/extras/5add809143141fad0a64d01f6f566a8d.webm?t=1788193999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865960/extras/5add809143141fad0a64d01f6f566a8d.mp4?t=1788193999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865960/extras/1324d4473b5107bb35d73a260b628481.avif?t=1788193999\" alt=\"Explore the Cortesia System\" width=400 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     The lawless expanse of the frontier offers the prospect of great opportunity for those independent Captains brave, or crazy, enough to risk it. Explore different colonies, space stations, asteroid bases, and more. Fame and fortune await those who can navigate Cortesia's many hazards, such as merciless pirates, volatile colonial politics, and the unrestrained ambition of Old Earth's Megacorporations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865960/extras/e9d71135672ef4c91a98daeb224159fa.poster.avif?t=1788193999\" aria-label=\"The captain sets their destination on the system map and begins sailing their ship towards it.\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865960/extras/e9d71135672ef4c91a98daeb224159fa.webm?t=1788193999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865960/extras/e9d71135672ef4c91a98daeb224159fa.mp4?t=1788193999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865960/extras/33f48792491233f1dde94bb2b5dec5a3.avif?t=1788193999\" alt=\"Assemble your crew\" width=400 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     As Captain of a Starship, it's up to you to outfit your ship and hire the right officers to manage your crew. Assemble your hand-picked team of Navy Veterans, former Pirates, shrewd Traders, eccentric Engineers, and more to lead your boarding actions, negotiate trade deals, put down mutinies, explore planets, or simply give your enemies another target to shoot at.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865960/extras/35e0a4d91173a2e3e74af83fb3611ea4.poster.avif?t=1788193999\" aria-label=\"The player browses and equipment shop and replaces the weapons of their officers with better ones.\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865960/extras/35e0a4d91173a2e3e74af83fb3611ea4.webm?t=1788193999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865960/extras/35e0a4d91173a2e3e74af83fb3611ea4.mp4?t=1788193999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865960/extras/01867931ee766ec6d2e8ad5c9ee4f554.avif?t=1788193999\" alt=\"Become a legend\" width=400 height=91 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     Build a fortune trading (or smuggling) goods between colonies, or terrorize the space lanes as a infamous pirate. Work with one of the many factions vying for control of Cortesia and its resources, or become their sworn enemy by opposing them. Every decision you make will not only determine the fate of you and your crew, but can have a lasting impact on the future of the Cortesia System.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865960/extras/136972710673d090eb102d6590a4307d.avif?t=1788193999\" width=450 height=99 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     Cortesia Rising is a Space Captain Simulator that combines spaceship battles, ship &amp; crew management, and turn-based tactical combat. Engage in broadside naval battles, run trading and smuggling operations, take on missions, explore planets, maintain crew morale through supplies and wages, and upgrade your ship.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865960/extras/ae958bc277495baab3cb12039c8fe0cb.poster.avif?t=1788193999\" aria-label=\"A single warship engages a line of merchant ships in a broadside battle.\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865960/extras/ae958bc277495baab3cb12039c8fe0cb.webm?t=1788193999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865960/extras/ae958bc277495baa