 the unrestrained ambition of Old Earth's Megacorporations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865960/extras/e9d71135672ef4c91a98daeb224159fa.poster.avif?t=1788193999\" aria-label=\"The captain sets their destination on the system map and begins sailing their ship towards it.\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865960/extras/e9d71135672ef4c91a98daeb224159fa.webm?t=1788193999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865960/extras/e9d71135672ef4c91a98daeb224159fa.mp4?t=1788193999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865960/extras/33f48792491233f1dde94bb2b5dec5a3.avif?t=1788193999\" alt=\"Assemble your crew\" width=400 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     As Captain of a Starship, it's up to you to outfit your ship and hire the right officers to manage your crew. Assemble your hand-picked team of Navy Veterans, former Pirates, shrewd Traders, eccentric Engineers, and more to lead your boarding actions, negotiate trade deals, put down mutinies, explore planets, or simply give your enemies another target to shoot at.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865960/extras/35e0a4d91173a2e3e74af83fb3611ea4.poster.avif?t=1788193999\" 